    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You roll initiative or your turn begins.</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Your resolve as a hunter and warrior is unflinching as it seems the very future of all that you value rides on your shoulders. You gain temporary hit points equal to your level. If a blow would reduce you to 0 hit points while you have these temporary hit points, you remain at 1 hit point instead. When this happens, you cannot use this feat until your next daily preparations.</span></p>"
